  "labelNotes": "Supply range taken from Recommended Operating Conditions (VIN 2.5-6.0 V); cited by symbol 'VIN' because 'Supply Voltage' is also a substring of the abs-max 'Power Supply Voltage' line. Standby current (ISTD, VEN off) counted as a supply current. No EN-pin input current is printed (only the 3.0 MOhm EN pull-down RPD), so pin_input_leakage is ABSENT; RPD and the 60 Ohm VOUT discharge resistor are pull-downs and excluded from recommended_pullup_ohm. ISHORT and IOUT(MAX) excluded as output/limit currents."
